{"query": {"id": "20260627174245146781_a9f79254", "handle": "q1", "text": "Ring 
of Nestor Mycenaean gold ring archaeological artifact discovery site dating 
iconography -site:en.wikipedia.org", "importance": "core"}, "items": [{"id": 
"20260627174407505493_01a27743", "type": "Evidence", "text": 
"文章描述，2015年在皮洛斯涅斯托尔宫殿附近发掘出一座未被扰动的迈锡尼武士墓，因随
葬象牙狮鹫牌饰而称为“狮鹫武士”墓。", "source_ids": 
["20260627174406311112_9d37ee67"], "citations": [1]}, {"id": 
"20260627174407541003_8bb579bb", "type": "Evidence", "text": 
"报道指出，该墓中出土了四枚实心黄金印章戒，其戒面刻有米诺斯风格的微型场景，被认
为是墓中最重要的发现之一。", "source_ids": ["20260627174406311112_9d37ee67"], 
"citations": [1]}, {"id": "20260627174407575637_b35d37fd", "type": "Evidence", 
"text": 
"文章提到其中一枚金质印章戒刻有牛跃场面，表现人物越过公牛，图像与克里特米诺斯宫
殿艺术中的牛跃场景平行。", "source_ids": ["20260627174406311112_9d37ee67"], 
"citations": [1]}, {"id": "20260627174407611885_4a93a13f", "type": "Evidence", 
"text": 
"辛辛那提大学的报道称，“狮鹫武士”墓约可定年为公元前1500年左右的晚期赫拉迪Ⅰ期，是
迈锡尼时代早期阶段。", "source_ids": ["20260627174406335122_2508d34d"], 
"citations": [2]}, {"id": "20260627174407645199_dc648fe5", "type": "Evidence", 
"text": 
"文章描述四枚戒指为金质印章或封印戒，其戒面以米诺斯印章雕刻技术制作极细致的浅浮
雕图像。", "source_ids": ["20260627174406335122_2508d34d"], "citations": [2]}, 
{"id": "20260627174407679769_83c88488", "type": "Evidence", "text": 
"报道详细说明一枚戒指上刻有人物翻越公牛的牛跃图，另一枚则刻有一位站立于仪式场景
中的女性人物，周围有其他人物与象征符号。", "source_ids": 
["20260627174406335122_2508d34d"], "citations": [2]}, {"id": 
"20260627174407713574_efe08d5a", "type": "Evidence", "text": "Greece Is 
的文章称，该战士墓含约1800件随葬品，其中包括四枚金质印章戒，墓葬年代约为公元前14
50年。", "source_ids": ["20260627174406355288_bef58bbd"], "citations": [3]}, 
{"id": "20260627174407746438_e4ae0495", "type": "Evidence", "text": 
"报道指出，一枚金印戒显示与米诺斯宫殿壁画相似的牛跃场景，另一枚则描绘处于仪式场
景中的女性人物。", "source_ids": ["20260627174406355288_bef58bbd"], "citations":
[3]}, {"id": "20260627174407780709_17136bb9", "type": "Evidence", "text": 
"Archaeology.wiki 
报道称，在涅斯托尔宫殿附近的晚期赫拉迪Ⅰ期墓葬中发现了四枚实心黄金戒指，并特别提
到一枚刻有克里特式牛跃场景的金戒指。", "source_ids": 
["20260627174406379393_aec0e19e"], "citations": [4]}, {"id": 
"20260627174407817320_6d8b6e6d", "type": "Evidence", "text": "Sci.News 
文章举例提到一枚金戒指，其图像为两头公牛左右被谷穗束夹 
flank，作者称这种组合在已知迈锡尼图像中相当罕见，并可能象征农业丰饶或权力。", 
"source_ids": ["20260627174406401075_502bdbce"], "citations": [5]}, {"id": 
"20260627174407852058_f1624d78", "type": "Evidence", "text": "Academia.edu 
上的摘要指出，该论文研究四枚饰有米诺斯图像的金质印章戒，它们出自皮洛斯附近一座晚
期赫拉迪墓葬，被视为讨论米诺斯宗教与神话图像向迈锡尼精英环境传播的重要材料。", 
"source_ids": ["20260627174406420747_ca49fe41"], "citations": [6]}, {"id": 
"20260627174429343765_1f6419c0", "type": "Claim", "text": "In 2015, 
archaeologists from the University of Cincinnati led by Jack L. Davis and Sharon
R. Stocker excavated an undisturbed Mycenaean elite warrior tomb near the Palace
of Nestor at Pylos, known as the ‘Griffin Warrior’ grave.", "source_ids": 
["20260627174406311112_9d37ee67", "20260627174406335122_2508d34d"], "citations":
[1, 2]}, {"id": "20260627174429406158_8fea7adb", "type": "Claim", "text": "The 
Griffin Warrior tomb at Pylos is dated to the early Mycenaean period, 
specifically Late Helladic I, around the mid‑16th century BCE (roughly 1500–1450
BCE).", "source_ids": ["20260627174406311112_9d37ee67", 
"20260627174406335122_2508d34d", "20260627174406355288_bef58bbd"], "citations": 
[1, 2, 3]}, {"id": "20260627174429514555_b8581b08", "type": "Claim", "text": 
"The Griffin Warrior tomb contained a very rich assemblage of grave goods, 
numbering around 1800–2000 items, including bronze weapons, jewelry, carved 
stones, and four solid-gold signet or seal rings.", "source_ids": 
["20260627174406311112_9d37ee67", "20260627174406355288_bef58bbd"], "citations":
[1, 3]}, {"id": "20260627174429600535_60eaec1e", "type": "Claim", "text": "Four 
solid-gold signet or seal rings from the Griffin Warrior tomb near Pylos are 
considered among the most important finds from the burial and are key artifacts 
for studying early Mycenaean elite culture.", "source_ids": 
["20260627174406311112_9d37ee67", "20260627174406355288_bef58bbd", 
"20260627174406379393_aec0e19e", "20260627174406420747_ca49fe41"], "citations": 
[1, 3, 4, 6]}, {"id": "20260627174429676740_e860136a", "type": "Claim", "text": 
"The four gold signet rings from the Griffin Warrior tomb are engraved in a 
Minoan style, using fine seal‑engraving techniques to produce detailed miniature
scenes in low relief.", "source_ids": ["20260627174406311112_9d37ee67", 
"20260627174406335122_2508d34d", "20260627174406355288_bef58bbd", 
"20260627174406379393_aec0e19e"], "citations": [1, 2, 3, 4]}, {"id": 
"20260627174429747467_88b278a1", "type": "Claim", "text": "The iconography on 
the four gold signet rings from the Griffin Warrior tomb includes human figures,
animals, and mythic or ritual scenes, notably a bull‑leaping scene and a scene 
with a standing woman in a ritual context.", "source_ids": 
["20260627174406311112_9d37ee67", "20260627174406335122_2508d34d", 
"20260627174406355288_bef58bbd"], "citations": [1, 2, 3]}, {"id": 
"20260627174429829565_8a36c6e7", "type": "Claim", "text": "One of the gold rings
from the Griffin Warrior tomb shows a Cretan‑style bull‑leaping scene with a 
human figure vaulting over a bull, closely paralleling bull‑leaping imagery in 
Minoan palace art and regarded as evidence for Minoan influence in the tomb’s 
assemblage.", "source_ids": ["20260627174406311112_9d37ee67", 
"20260627174406379393_aec0e19e"], "citations": [1, 4]}, {"id": 
"20260627174429892345_a0caa3c3", "type": "Claim", "text": "Another gold ring 
from the Griffin Warrior tomb depicts a standing female figure in a ritual scene
surrounded by other figures and symbols, commonly interpreted as a goddess or 
priestess, though this identification remains speculative.", "source_ids": 
["20260627174406335122_2508d34d", "20260627174406355288_bef58bbd"], "citations":
[2, 3]}, {"id": "20260627174429956685_50eb9a22", "type": "Claim", "text": 
"Scholarly and institutional sources treat the four gold signet rings from the 
Griffin Warrior tomb as prime evidence for the transmission and adaptation of 
Minoan religious and mythological imagery into early Mycenaean elite contexts on
the Greek mainland.", "source_ids": ["20260627174406335122_2508d34d", 
"20260627174406420747_ca49fe41"], "citations": [2, 6]}], "offset": 0, "limit": 
20, "total": 21, "next_offset": 20}
