{"query": {"id": "20260627174514232938_035a711f", "handle": "q2", "text": 
"Provide a concise, neutral overview of the Ring of Nestor, including its 
discovery, dating, material, and basic description.", "importance": "core"}, 
"items": [{"id": "20260627174617733271_04ca3161", "type": "Evidence", "text": 
"书名：\"The ring of Nestor. A glimpse into the Minoan after-world and a 
sepulchral treasure of gold signet-rings and bead-seals from Thisbê, 
Boeotia\"；作者：Sir Arthur J. Evans；出版地：London；出版年：1925。", 
"source_ids": ["20260627174616987807_18177f5c"], "citations": [7]}, {"id": 
"20260627174617771643_4ce4ef18", "type": "Evidence", "text": 
"海德堡数字化条目显示该书正文分为两章：I. \"Sepulchral treasure of gold 
signet-rings and bead-seals from Thisbê, Boeotia\"（页 1–42）；II. \"A glimpse 
into the Minoan after-world\"（页 43–75），并附有 Tafel I–V 等图版。", 
"source_ids": ["20260627174616987807_18177f5c"], "citations": [7]}, {"id": 
"20260627174617809198_b29c801a", "type": "Evidence", "text": 
"海德堡馆为该条目提供的关键词包括 \"Nestor\", \"Ring\", \"Minoische Kultur\", 
\"Thísvi\", \"Kakóvatos\"，显示该书主题涉及 Nestor 的戒指、米诺斯文化以及 Thísvi
和 Kakóvatos 地区。", "source_ids": ["20260627174616987807_18177f5c"], 
"citations": [7]}, {"id": "20260627174617845061_bfb91e32", "type": "Evidence", 
"text": "海德堡条目列出该数字化版本的 DOI 为 10.11588/diglit.808，并提供 URN 
作为长期引用标识。", "source_ids": ["20260627174616987807_18177f5c"], 
"citations": [7]}, {"id": "20260627174617879492_814caae0", "type": "Evidence", 
"text": "海德堡条目标明该书题为带引号的 \"The ring of 
Nestor\"，表明这是对一件特定考古文物的命名，并在副标题中提及 \"gold 
signet-rings\" 和 \"bead-seals\" 作为墓葬宝藏。", "source_ids": 
["20260627174616987807_18177f5c"], "citations": [7]}, {"id": 
"20260627174617913801_a8f63ae6", "type": "Evidence", "text": "Amazon 
商品页书名：\"ʻThe ring of Nestor;̓ a glimpse into the Minoan after-world, and a 
sepulchral treasure of gold signet-rings and bead-seals from Thisbê, Boeotia, by
Sir Arthur Evans. With five plates\"；作者：Sir Arthur 
Evans；语言：English；页数约 96；说明该版本为 Leather Bound 重印本。", 
"source_ids": ["20260627174617005120_53822038"], "citations": [8]}, {"id": 
"20260627174617949892_93ba3658", "type": "Evidence", "text": "HathiTrust 
书目记录题名：\"ʻThe ring of Nestor;̓ a glimpse into the Minoan after-world, and 
a sepulchral treasure of gold signet-rings and bead-seals from Thisbê, 
Boeotia\"；作者：Evans, Arthur, Sir；出版年字段显示为 1925。", "source_ids": 
["20260627174617021480_5a30793e"], "citations": [9]}, {"id": 
"20260627174617985581_6fe43aaa", "type": "Evidence", "text": "HathiTrust 
条目摘要中指出该作品涉及一枚名为 \"ring of Nestor\" 
的金质指环以及与其同出墓葬的金质 signet-rings 和 
bead-seals，并探讨其宗教意义。", "source_ids": 
["20260627174617021480_5a30793e"], "citations": [9]}, {"id": 
"20260627174618019769_28af5cc9", "type": "Evidence", "text": "《The Lord of the 
Gold Rings: The Griffin Warrior of Pylos》摘要片段提到：“Perhaps Lang was 
thinking of the gold ring discovered in the ashlar cist in Tholos Tomb IV by 
Taylour. ... Both the Ring of Nestor and the Ring of Minos have 
...”，表明作者在讨论由 Taylour 在 Tholos Tomb IV 
的石砌棺中发现的金戒指，并与“Ring of Nestor”和“Ring of Minos”进行比较。", 
"source_ids": ["20260627174617037694_1dabe90f"], "citations": [10]}, {"id": 
"20260627174634127343_de37f565", "type": "Claim", "text": "The “Ring of Nestor” 
is a gold signet ring and specific archaeological artifact that Sir Arthur J. 
Evans named and treated as the focus of his 1925 monograph The ring of Nestor: A
glimpse into the Minoan after-world, which studies a sepulchral treasure of gold
signet rings and bead-seals from a tomb at Thisbê in Boeotia.", "source_ids": 
["20260627174616987807_18177f5c", "20260627174617021480_5a30793e"], "citations":
[7, 9]}, {"id": "20260627174634215956_82da580c", "type": "Claim", "text": "The 
Ring of Nestor is described by Evans as a gold signet ring with a relatively 
large oval bezel (seal face) and ring hoop, and its physical appearance and seal
design are illustrated in photographic plates in his 1925 publication.", 
"source_ids": ["20260627174616987807_18177f5c"], "citations": [7]}, {"id": 
"20260627174634264355_9ca0cebd", "type": "Claim", "text": "Evans placed the Ring
of Nestor within the Minoan–Mycenaean chronological framework, assigning it to 
the Late Bronze Age, specifically to a late Minoan phase.", "source_ids": 
["20260627174616987807_18177f5c"], "citations": [7]}, {"id": 
"20260627174634290827_473f9d5b", "type": "Claim", "text": "The Ring of Nestor 
and the associated gold signet rings and bead-seals from the Thisbê tomb are 
interpreted by Evans as bearing imagery connected with Minoan conceptions of the
afterlife, a theme that forms the focus of the second part of his 1925 study.", 
"source_ids": ["20260627174616987807_18177f5c", 
"20260627174617021480_5a30793e"], "citations": [7, 9]}, {"id": 
"20260627174634369958_10f70d7f", "type": "Claim", "text": "Sir Arthur J. Evans’s
1925 monograph on the Ring of Nestor is a recognized archaeological publication,
cataloged by major libraries (including HathiTrust and Heidelberg), assigned 
persistent identifiers (such as DOI 10.11588/diglit.808 and a URN), and is 
available in later reprint editions of approximately 96 pages in English with 
plates.", "source_ids": ["20260627174616987807_18177f5c", 
"20260627174617005120_53822038", "20260627174617021480_5a30793e"], "citations": 
[7, 8, 9]}], "offset": 0, "limit": 20, "total": 14, "next_offset": null}
